{"seconds": 42.7, "exit": 0, "final": "So the line is: Nxf7+ Ke8 (or Kc8, or Ke7) Nxh8 and White wins the rook. Even if Black recaptures the bishop, White is up a rook for a bishop, a significant material advantage. This is clearly the best move.\n\n**Best move:** Nxf7+\n\n**Main line:** Nxf7+ Ke8 (or Kc8) Nxh8 Qxf4 and White has won a full rook.\n\n**Motif:** Fork (the knight forks the king and rook)\n\n**Coaching note (for the player):**\nYour knight on e5 forks Black's king on d8 and the rook on h8. After Nxf7+, the king must move and you capture the undefended rook with Nxh8\u2014netting a full rook. Always scan for knight forks near the opponent's king; they're easy to miss but instantly winning.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Nxf7+\", \"line\": [\"Nxf7+\", \"Ke8\", \"Nxh8\", \"Qxf4\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1ppp/5q2/n2nN3/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 w - - 4 16"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1ppp/5q2/n2nN3/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 w - - 4 16"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1ppp/5q2/n2nN3/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 w - - 4 16"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1ppp/5q2/n2nN3/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 w - - 4 16", "move": "Nxf7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1ppp/5q2/n2nN3/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 w - - 4 16", "move": "Ne6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1ppp/5q2/n2nN3/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 w - - 4 16", "move": "Nec6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1ppp/5q2/n2nN3/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 w - - 4 16", "move": "Ndc6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1Npp/5q2/n2n4/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 b - - 0 16", "move": "Qxf7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "r2k3r/pppb1Npp/5q2/n2n4/3N1B2/8/PPP1BPPP/3R1RK1 b 